with the player and the boulder. Here I dug out the corner of the room 
in wizmode:

    @-----------
   #|0."........###
   #|.0....$.4.|
   #---+--------
   ### #

('0' are boulders)

moving SE from this position gives:

   You try to move the boulder, but in vain.
   However, you can squeeze yourself into a small opening.

... _or_ you are "very small" (size < MZ_SMALL, currently must be 
MZ_TINY) - in which case inventory restrictions are lifted as well. Here 
I am the 'a', a queen bee:

    .-----------
   #|0.a........###
   #|.0....$.).|
   #---+--------
   ### #

